<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-NATAL 215-5 AT TEA AGAINST TRANSVAAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NATAL 215-5 AT TEA AGAINST TRANSVAAL.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natal were 215 for five from 66 overs at tea in their four day Supersport Series match against Transvaal in Johannesburg on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Natal 215-5 from 66 overs (Jonty Rhodes 56 not out) against Transvaal.</p>
